        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miandab Hesekia ak kisoobi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimian Hesekia eng’ betusiechoto kot ko negit kome. Ak kinyo ole mi inendet Isaia maotiot weritab Amos, ak kolenji inendet, Mwaei Jehovah ko u ni kole, Rarji ket bikab gong’ung’; amu imee, mesobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowelel anyun Hesekia togennyi kogeer inat, ak kosa Jehovah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kole, Ee Jehovah, asain ale, ibwat ole kiatepte eng’ imanda eng’ taing’ung’ ak eng’ muguleldo ne igesunotgei, ak kiayai ne mie eng’ taing’ung’. Ak kirir Hesekia eng’ ng’wanindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyonji anyun ng’olyotab Jehovah Isaia kolenji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ui mwachi Hesekia ilenji, Mwaei Jehovah Kamuktaindetab Daudi kwandang’ung’ ko u ni kole, Kaagas saeng’ung’, kaageer beeguk bo kong’: keero, atesyini betusieguk kenyisiek taman ak mut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak asorun koboto nganasani eng’ eunekab laitoriatab Asuria: ak aribe nganasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak egu ni kaborunet eng’ inye ne bunu Jehovah, kele yaei Jehovah kii kagomwa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keero, aweechi uruet ne bo tilutik ne kagorekta koboto asista eng’ kit ne kirogendoe saisiek, ne bo Ahas, koweek kwo let tilutik taman. Kotogos anyun asista tilutik taman eng’ kioto kirogendoisie ne kaga korektae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kongoi ne bo Hesekia amu kigisoob eng’ miandanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chu ng’alek che kisir Hesekia laitoriatab Juda, ye kiga komian, kot kosob eng’ miandanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiamwa ale, Achute kurgetab kererit, eng’ kwenutab betusiekyuk; Kagirebena betusiekyuk che ng’etunotin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiamwa ale, Ma ageere Jehovah, inendet Jehovah eng’ emetab bik che soptos: Ma ageere chito kogeny koboto che menyei ng’ony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kageisto meng’otennyu, kageibena ko u emait ne bo mestowot: Kiamaman sobondanyu ko u ye mamanisiei chito ne nabisiei; istoa eng’ ketit ne kinabisie: Igeswa koboch bet agoi kemoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiasis kot koeech; irie kowekyuk tugul ko u ng’etundo: Igeswa koboch bet agoi kemoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiatwegu anyun ko u kibiswet anan cheptalamiat: Kiarir ko u cheptuget: kianyal barak kot koimenitu konyekyuk; Ee Jehovah, kinyalila, egu ne tononwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwae nee anyun? King’alalwa, ak kigoyai inendet kosulda: Awendi mutyo kenyisiekyuk tugul amu ng’wanindab sobondanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Kiptaiyat, soptos bik eng’ tuguchuto, Ak mitei sobondab tamirmiriennyu tuguchoto tugul: Inyaa anyun, ak igona asob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keero, kianyoru ng’wanindo ne o agobo kalyennyu: Ago kiisoru sobondanyu komong’une keringetab ng’emisiet amu ichame: Amu kiiwirte tengekwogikyuk koba let. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu maimuchi kererit kolosun, maimuchi meet kobwatin: Maimuchi komang’ imandang’ung icheget che chorjingei keringet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilosun che soptos, ee che soptos, ko u ye alosun ra: Iborjin kwanda lagok imandang’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chobot Jehovah kosorua; Kitieni anyun tienwogikyuk eng’ kibugandinikab inoik Eng’ betusiek tugul che bo sobennyo eng’ gotab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiga komwa Isaia kole, Ingoib logoekab mogoonik che inurotin, ak konuge ole mi burasta, si kosob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiga mwa Hesekia kole, Nee kaborunet ne iborua kole atogostoi gotab Jehovah?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
